### Using setMonth()

```js
const theBigDay = new Date();
theBigDay.setMonth(6);

// Watch out for end of month transitions
const endOfMonth = new Date(2016, 7, 31);
endOfMonth.setMonth(1);
console.log(endOfMonth); // Wed Mar 02 2016 00:00:00
```

