### Parameters

See [`TypedArray`](/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/TypedArray#parameters).

### Exceptions

See [`TypedArray`](/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/TypedArray#exceptions).

